{
 "_comment": [
  "Which regional manager covers which communities. Fill in `managers` and the",
  "Regional manager filter on the dashboard lights up; leave it empty and the",
  "dimension shows as unavailable rather than silently missing.",
  "",
  "THIS FILE IS THE SOURCE OF TRUTH, because nothing else is. The Property Data",
  "Sheet has 41 columns and no manager field. Rent Manager has property groups",
  "named after people -- AG Properties, LS Properties, Wendy, Natalie, Jordan",
  "Young -- but they cannot be used:",
  "",
  "  1. Membership can only be read back through a report, and every report",
  "     filters its own way. AgedReceivables returns only properties that owe",
  "     something, so an empty result means no receivables, not an empty group.",
  "  2. Nothing says those groups mean management rather than ownership. AG came",
  "     back with 23 of 64 communities, which is either a large book or a",
  "     completely different kind of grouping.",
  "",
  "Guessing between those was not worth a wrong org chart on a dashboard the",
  "regionals themselves read, so this file exists instead.",
  "",
  "FORMAT: manager name -> list of community short names. A community may appear",
  "under only one manager. Names are matched against `short_name` first and then",
  "the community name, both case-insensitively.",
  "",
  "Anything left out lands under 'Unassigned' in the filter, so a community that",
  "is added to the portfolio and forgotten here is visible rather than hidden."
 ],
